-- ▶ wearable-tokens.sql

-- ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
-- Repple wearable OAuth tokens — one row per (user, cloud provider). Written ONLY
-- by the wearable-oauth / wearable-day edge functions via the service role, so
